:IsValidPartitionedDML where it failed to parse PostgreSQL parameter placeholders\r\n\r\n    *   Support setting or dropping NOT NULL in PostgreSQL.\r\n\r\n    *   Allow updating tables with indexes storing pending commit timestamps.\r\n\r\n    *   Fix emulator feature flags returning references after losing lock in issue 370.\r\n\r\n    *   Fix nullptr issue in Change Stream schema changes in issue 371.\r\n\r\nNew Feature\r\n\r\n    *   DDL support for cloud queue \r\n\r\n    *   Support creating tables without user-defined primary keys.\r\n\r\n    *   Add support for TABLESAMPLE to the PostgreSQL dialect.\r\n\r\n    *   Increase max tables per database to 5000 and max indexes per database to 10000.\r\n\r\n    *   Support `IS DISTINCT FROM` / `IS NOT DISTINCT FROM` expressions in Spanner Emulator."}